flowchart TD
    classDef public fill:#f6ffed,stroke:#52c41a,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef security fill:#fff1f0,stroke:#f5222d,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef core fill:#f0f5ff,stroke:#2f54eb,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef storage fill:#fffbe6,stroke:#faad14,stroke-width:2px;

    PublicUser([Masyarakat / Konstituen]):::public --> OpenLink[Buka Link dari Medsos / WhatsApp]:::public
    OpenLink --> EdgeCDN[Edge CDN Caching Node]:::public
    
    EdgeCDN --> ViewArticle[Membaca Artikel Lengkap & Mengunduh Infografis]:::public
    
    ViewArticle --> DecideFeedback{Apakah Warga Ingin Mengirimkan Aspirasi?}:::public
    DecideFeedback -->|Tidak| ReadOnlyEnd([Selesai Membaca]):::public
    DecideFeedback -->|Ya| OpenFeedbackWidget[Buka Widget 'Kirim Masukan ke Dewan']:::public

    subgraph BotDefense [Lapisan Keamanan Publik]
        OpenFeedbackWidget --> InputMessage[Isi: Nama, Kecamatan, Pesan Aduan/Aspirasi]:::public
        InputMessage --> RunCaptcha{Cloudflare Turnstile Challenge}:::security
        RunCaptcha -->|Bot Terdeteksi| DropSubmission[Tolak & Blokir IP]:::security
        RunCaptcha -->|Manusia Valid| RateLimitCheck{Cek Rate Limit IP}:::security
        RateLimitCheck -->|Spamming| DropSubmission
    end

    subgraph PrivacyFilter [UU PDP Compliance Pipeline]
        RateLimitCheck -->|Lolos| MaskPII[Enkripsi & Pisahkan Data Kontak Pribadi]:::security
        MaskPII --> SaveToPrivateInbox[(Simpan ke Private Inbox Dewan)]:::storage
    end

    SaveToPrivateInbox --> UpdateMetrics[Agregasi Metrik Sentimen & Isu Wilayah Dapil]:::core
    UpdateMetrics --> NotifyDewan[Notifikasi Masukan Baru Muncul di Dashboard Dewan]:::core